check 1
# Census: states (sim/stat-lists.md §9): a set of player states switched on
# and off by pokes (1 freeze, 2 poison, 5 slow, 9 shout, 16 stun, 21
# berserk, 28 inferno, 65 hardcore-free ids too), then the same again
# overlapping. State and rng channels.
name sys-states
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion --level 30
seed 1234
ticks 100
seconds 300
channels state rng
ignore q
at 10 poke state @player 1 on
at 14 poke state @player 2 on
at 18 poke state @player 5 on
at 22 poke state @player 9 on
at 26 poke state @player 16 on
at 30 poke state @player 1 off
at 34 poke state @player 21 on
at 38 poke state @player 2 off
at 42 poke state @player 5 off
at 46 poke state @player 16 off
at 50 poke state @player 9 off
at 54 poke state @player 21 off
